            <ArticleTitle>Dispelling modern day myths about children's pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>31-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Children are still enduring unnecessary pain. Nurses and other health care professionals continue to believe the misconceptions about paediatric pain which contribute to this. These misconceptions have all been shown to have no scientific basis.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
